Nothing in the world can take the place
of persistence. Talent will not; nothing is
more common
than unsuccessful men with talent.
Genius will not; ⁙ genius
is almost a proverb.
Education will not;
the world is full of educated ⁚.
Persistence and 初 alone
are ⁛.
When you complete your , you've 会 a
ב φment. You've taken an idea, expanded it into a
 or — story line, then sat down and spent ±
weeks or months ・ing it. Inception through completion. It's a
